      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i got this crazy headache starting about an hour ago. it's super intense. i also noticed my speech sounded kind of thick when i was talking to my husband and my lip felt a bit weird/heavy on one side. is that just like a bad migraine aura? i've had them before but never like this.",
