      "content": "but i feel like i'm already having the 'difficulty speaking' part you mentioned, it's just that my words are a little slurred not impossible to understand. and the facial thing is pretty mild. if i just take a high dose of some extra strength aspirin and sleep it off, will that help clear up the aura? i'd much rather just manage it at home if you think it's just a severe migraine. what's a safe amount to take to make sure this headache actually goes away?",
